Modifications
-------------
Multiwarden's own code lives in files under multiwarden/ directories and in
.github/workflows/multiwarden-*.yml. Every place where an upstream Bitwarden file
was changed is marked with a "Multiwarden:" comment; run

    git grep -n "Multiwarden:"

to list them. multiwarden/upstream-commit records the upstream commit this
version is based on, and the git history records the date of every change.

Bitwarden License code
----------------------
The bitwarden_license/ directory contains code under the Bitwarden License
Agreement (LICENSE_BITWARDEN.txt), not the GPL. It is kept only so that the
repository stays close to upstream. Multiwarden is built from the GPL code
alone: none of its builds or releases include or use bitwarden_license/.

